    {"op": "note", "text": "Path: with Boone hired (companion-boone.actions.json; given) and open enough (nOpenness 5, given: his trust grows with the player's deeds), he admits what happened at Bitter Springs (adds Topic036); asked whether he still thinks of it, he refuses to go back but the quest starts with a day's delay (nInitiateDay); a day later he asks to go after all (bInitiateQuest; objective 10); at Bitter Springs he says where they were posted (10 done, 20); on Coyote Tail Ridge he tells the story and asks to stay the night (30); the night passes (VMS39Timer: objective 40) and he wakes the player to a Legion raid; the player goes to the camp's defence (50); three waves die (VMS39Timer: 60); afterwards Boone finds his peace (Topic057: CompleteQuest VMS39, NCR fame, his armour). No stage is set on this path: the quest's completing stage 70 is set by no script in FalloutNV.esm [observed], so the quest completes by CompleteQuest and the coverage counts only the stages it shows."},
